      "title": "Cinematic Annotate",
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "widgets_values": [
        "Generate cinematic camera-path annotations from one image with **Cinematic Annotate**.\n\n## How It Works\n1. Upload a clean image\n2. Run **Cinematic Annotate**\n3. The system:\n    - Creates a director-style annotation with Nano Banana 2\n    - Converts the markup into a Seedance 2.0 motion prompt with Gemini\n    - Uses the original image as the clean video reference\n    - Saves the annotation image and final video\n\n## Tips\n- Use clear cinematic images with strong depth and motion potential\n- 21:9 works best for dramatic camera moves\n- Avoid text, logos, and cluttered subjects\n- The annotation is only a guide and will not appear in the video\n\n## That’s it.\n\nCamera blocking to video in ComfyUI with **Cinematic Annotate**."
      ]
    }
